## Succession and lapse (the hundred-year clause)

Successor steward: named by Kody Wildfeuer in a signed commit to this file; until then, Wildhaven Homes LLC.
Lapse: if no steward merges a conformance change or answers a conformance claim for five years, the name and the
mark pass to whoever keeps `spec/v1/conformance.json` green in public, with this file's history as the record
(written in advance so the OpenJDK outcome never needs a lawsuit).
